"""audit_gates — 跨叶子校验脚本.

完整 SPEC 见同目录 AUDIT-GATES.md.

每个 gate 是个 check 函数: check_<gate_id>(...) -> GateResult
GateResult 含 status (PASS/FAIL/SKIP) + msg + evidence.

用法:
  from audit_gates import GATES, run_all, run_one

  results = run_all()           # 跑全部
  result = run_one("GATE-OP-02")
"""

